</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Galuppi</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Development and reliability of a system to classify gross motor function in children with cerebral palsy</article-title><source>Dev Med Child Neurol</source><year>1997</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>214</fpage><lpage>23</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9183258</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jahnsen</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Aamodt</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosenbaum</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gross Motor Function Classification System used in adults with cerebral palsy: agreement of self-reported versus professional rating</article-title><source>Dev Med Child Neurol</source><year>2006</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>734</fpage><lpage>738</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16904019</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1017/S0012162206001575</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rosenbaum</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Walter</surname><given-names>SD</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanna</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Palisano</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Russell</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Raina</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Wood</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Bartlett</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Galuppi</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prognosis for gross motor function in children with cerebral palsy: creation of motor development curves</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>20